    <title>CF1452D 题解</title>
    <url>/2026/11/02/CF1452D%20%E9%A2%98%E8%A7%A3/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<h2 id="题意简述"><a href="#题意简述" class="headerlink" title="题意简述"></a>题意简述</h2><p>对于 $1$ 到 $n$ 的每个位置，都可以选择是否建造信号塔。</p>
<p>若在位置 $i$ 建造强度为 $p$ 的信号塔，则其覆盖区间为</p>
<p>$[i-p,\ i+p]$.</p>
<p>因此，一个合法方案可以看成若干个奇数长度区间的拼接。</p>
<blockquote>
<p>tag:计数 动态规划</p>
<p>难度cf1350 洛谷普及</p>
</blockquote>
<p>合法方案要求：</p>
<ol>
<li>任意两个信号塔的覆盖区间不相交；</li>
<li>所有覆盖区间都不能超出 $[1,n]$；</li>
<li>每个位置以 $1&#x2F;2$ 的概率建造信号塔。</li>
</ol>
<p>求最终方案合法的概率。</p>
<h2 id="思考"><a href="#思考" class="headerlink" title="思考"></a>思考</h2><p>首先可以想到对于一个位置建不建造的选择有2种,所以所有情况就是 $2^n$,于是题目就转化为了计数问题,问有多少种情况合法最后乘上逆元就好了</p>
<p>于是题目就变成了求解找合法方案的个数,对于1到n的范围用长度只能是奇数的块覆盖,例如对于长的为5的块可以是长度为4的块加上一块或者长度为2的加上一个长度为3的块,和长度为0的块加长度为5的块就是</p>
<p>定义$f[i]$ 定义是长度为i的被完全覆盖的合法方案有多少种</p>
<p>考虑最后一个信号塔。假设它覆盖的区间长度为 $i-j$，<br>由于覆盖区间长度一定是奇数，所以 $i-j$ 必须为奇数。</p>
<p>前面的长度为 $j$ 的区间可以独立构成一个合法方案，<br>因此有：</p>
<p>$$f[i]&#x3D;\sum_{\substack{0\le j&lt;i\i-j\text{ 是奇数}}}f[j]$$</p>
<p>例如，当 $i&#x3D;5$ 时，满足 $5-j$ 为奇数的 $j$ 有 $0,2,4$，<br>所以：</p>
<p>$$f[5]&#x3D;f[0]+f[2]+f[4]$$</p>
<p>其中 $f[0]&#x3D;1$ 表示空区间有一种方案，$f[1]&#x3D;f[2]&#x3D;1$ 是根据题目边界直接得到的初始情况.</p>
<p>当 $i$ 为奇数时，为了保证 $i-j$ 为奇数，$j$ 必须为偶数，因此 $f[i]$ 是所有偶数下标 $f[j]$ 的和。</p>
<p>当 $i$ 为偶数时，$j$ 必须为奇数，因此 $f[i]$ 是所有奇数下标 $f[j]$ 的和。</p>
<p>因此只需维护奇数下标和 <code>sum_odd</code> 以及偶数下标和 <code>sum_even</code>，即可在 $O(1)$ 时间内计算每个状态。</p>
<p>至于逆元的话直接用快速幂就好了</p>
<h2 id="代码"><a href="#代码" class="headerlink" title="代码"></a>代码</h2><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> <span class="keyword">namespace</span> std;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">typedef</span> <span class="type">long</span> <span class="type">long</span> ll;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">const</span> ll mod = <span class="number">998244353</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function">ll <span class="title">qpow</span><span class="params">(ll a, ll b, ll mod)</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    ll res = <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">while</span> (b &gt; <span class="number">0</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    &#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> (b &amp; <span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        &#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">            res = (res * a) % mod;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        a = (a * a) % mod;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        b &gt;&gt;= <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> res;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title">solve</span><span class="params">()</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    ll n;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    cin &gt;&gt; n;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="function">vector&lt;ll&gt; <span class="title">f</span><span class="params">(n + <span class="number">1</span>, <span class="number">0</span>)</span></span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    f[<span class="number">0</span>] = f[<span class="number">1</span>] = f[<span class="number">2</span>] = <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    ll sum_odd = <span class="number">1</span>, sum_even = <span class="number">2</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">3</span>; i &lt;= n; i++)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    &#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> (i % <span class="number">2</span> == <span class="number">0</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        &#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">            f[i] = sum_odd % mod;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">            sum_even = (sum_even + sum_odd) % mod;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">else</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        &#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">            f[i] = sum_even % mod;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">            sum_odd = (sum_odd + sum_even) % mod;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    ll res = <span class="built_in">qpow</span>(<span class="number">2</span>, n, mod);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    res = <span class="built_in">qpow</span>(res, mod - <span class="number">2</span>, mod);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    cout &lt;&lt; (f[n] * res) % mod &lt;&lt; endl;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    ll T = <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// cin &gt;&gt; T;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">while</span> (T--)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    &#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">solve</span>();</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
]]></content>
      <categories>
        <category>题解</category>
      </categories>
