    <title>CF2277C 题解</title>
    <url>/2026/11/11/CF2277C%20%E9%A2%98%E8%A7%A3/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<h2 id="题意简述"><a href="#题意简述" class="headerlink" title="题意简述"></a>题意简述</h2><p>给一棵以 $1$ 为起点、要到达 $n$ 的树，以及 $m$ 次操作。每次操作先加一条边 $(1,v_i)$，再从新形成的环上删一条边，使图仍然是一棵树。</p>
<p>求经过所有操作后，$1$ 到 $n$ 的距离最大是多少。</p>
<blockquote>
<p>tag：树、贪心</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p>难度：CF 1300</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="思考"><a href="#思考" class="headerlink" title="思考"></a>思考</h2><p>先把原树以 $1$ 为根，求出每个点的深度和父节点。原本 $1$ 到 $n$ 的距离就是 <code>dep[n] - 1</code>，这是答案的初始值，因为每次都可以直接删掉刚加上的边，让树保持不变。</p>
<h3 id="一次操作能带来什么变化"><a href="#一次操作能带来什么变化" class="headerlink" title="一次操作能带来什么变化"></a>一次操作能带来什么变化</h3><p>加入边 $(1,x)$ 后，环由新边和树上 $1$ 到 $x$ 的路径组成。若删除新边，操作没有效果；若删除原树边，才可能改变 $1$ 到 $n$ 的路径。</p>
<p>最终的 $1$ 到 $n$ 简单路径至多使用一条新增边：所有新增边都连着 $1$，而简单路径不能重复经过 $1$。因此，其他操作都可以不改变树，答案只需考虑某个操作点 $x$ 单独带来的最大收益。</p>
<p>设 $p$ 是 $x$ 和 $n$ 的最近公共祖先。若 $x$ 不在原来的 $1$ 到 $n$ 路径上，且 $p\ne 1$，那么 $1$ 到 $p$ 的路径上存在一条边，同时位于 $1\to x$ 和 $1\to n$ 两条路径上。执行 $(1,x)$ 并删掉这条公共路径上的边后，新的 $1\to n$ 路径可以从新增边走到 $x$，再沿原树走到 $n$。</p>
<p>新路径长度为：</p>
<p>$$</p>
<p>1+\operatorname{dist}(x,n)</p>
<p>&#x3D;1+\operatorname{dep}[x]+\operatorname{dep}[n]-2\operatorname{dep}[p]</p>
<p>$$</p>
<p>若 $x$ 在原主路径上，或者 $p&#x3D;1$，则无法用这种方式绕行增加距离，不必考虑。</p>
<h3 id="不用每次求-LCA"><a href="#不用每次求-LCA" class="headerlink" title="不用每次求 LCA"></a>不用每次求 LCA</h3><p>所有查询的终点都是 $n$，可以先标记原树上 $1\to n$ 的主路径。再遍历整棵树，为每个不在主路径上的点记录它从主路径分出的节点 <code>shang[x]</code>。这个点就是 $x$ 与 $n$ 的 LCA，所以查询时直接使用 <code>shang[x]</code> 即可，不需要倍增求 LCA。</p>
<p>遍历时，沿主路径向下走就更新分叉点；进入不在主路径上的子树后，分叉点保持不变。</p>
<h3 id="算法步骤"><a href="#算法步骤" class="headerlink" title="算法步骤"></a>算法步骤</h3><ol>
<li><p>迭代遍历树，求 <code>par</code> 和 <code>dep</code>。</p>
</li>
<li><p>从 $n$ 沿父节点回溯到 $1$，标记主路径，初始答案设为 <code>dep[n] - 1</code>。</p>
</li>
<li><p>再次迭代遍历，求每个非主路径点的 <code>shang[x]</code>。</p>
</li>
<li><p>读入每个操作点 $x$，若它不在主路径上且 <code>shang[x] != 1</code>，用上面的公式更新答案。</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="复杂度"><a href="#复杂度" class="headerlink" title="复杂度"></a>复杂度</h2><p>每个点和每次操作都只处理常数次，时间复杂度 $O(n+m)$，空间复杂度 $O(n)$。</p>
<h2 id="代码"><a href="#代码" class="headerlink" title="代码"></a>代码</h2><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> <span class="keyword">namespace</span> std;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">typedef</span> <span class="type">long</span> <span class="type">long</span> ll;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">const</span> <span class="type">int</span> N = <span class="number">5e5</span> + <span class="number">7</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">vector&lt;<span class="type">int</span>&gt; e[N];</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">struct</span> <span class="title class_">Node</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> u, fa, top;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125;;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title">solve</span><span class="params">()</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> n, m;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">cin &gt;&gt; n &gt;&gt; m;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">1</span>; i &lt;= n; i++)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">e[i].<span class="built_in">clear</span>();</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">1</span>; i &lt; n; i++)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> u, v;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">cin &gt;&gt; u &gt;&gt; v;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">e[u].<span class="built_in">push_back</span>(v);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">e[v].<span class="built_in">push_back</span>(u);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function">vector&lt;<span class="type">int</span>&gt; <span class="title">par</span><span class="params">(n + <span class="number">1</span>)</span>, <span class="title">dep</span><span class="params">(n + <span class="number">1</span>)</span></span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">par[<span class="number">1</span>] = <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">dep[<span class="number">1</span>] = <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">stack&lt;<span class="type">int</span>&gt; st;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">st.<span class="built_in">push</span>(<span class="number">1</span>);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">while</span> (!st.<span class="built_in">empty</span>())</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> u = st.<span class="built_in">top</span>();</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">st.<span class="built_in">pop</span>();</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> v : e[u])</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> (v == par[u])</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">continue</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">par[v] = u;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">dep[v] = dep[u] + <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">st.<span class="built_in">push</span>(v);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function">vector&lt;<span class="type">bool</span>&gt; <span class="title">onPath</span><span class="params">(n + <span class="number">1</span>, <span class="literal">false</span>)</span></span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> u = n; u != <span class="number">0</span>; u = par[u])</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">onPath[u] = <span class="literal">true</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> (u == <span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">break</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">ll ans = dep[n] - <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function">vector&lt;<span class="type">int</span>&gt; <span class="title">shang</span><span class="params">(n + <span class="number">1</span>)</span></span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">stack&lt;Node&gt; st2;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">st2.<span class="built_in">push</span>(&#123;<span class="number">1</span>, <span class="number">0</span>, <span class="number">1</span>&#125;);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">while</span> (!st2.<span class="built_in">empty</span>())</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">auto</span> [u, fa, top] = st2.<span class="built_in">top</span>();</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">st2.<span class="built_in">pop</span>();</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> (!onPath[u])</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">shang[u] = top;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> v : e[u])</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> (v == fa)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">continue</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> (onPath[v])</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">st2.<span class="built_in">push</span>(&#123;v, u, v&#125;);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">else</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">st2.<span class="built_in">push</span>(&#123;v, u, top&#125;);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">0</span>; i &lt; m; i++)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> x;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">cin &gt;&gt; x;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> (!onPath[x] &amp;&amp; shang[x] != <span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> p = shang[x];</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">ll candidate = <span class="number">1LL</span> + dep[x] + dep[n] - <span class="number">2LL</span> * dep[p];</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">ans = <span class="built_in">max</span>(ans, candidate);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">cout &lt;&lt; ans &lt;&lt; <span class="string">&#x27;\n&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">ios::<span class="built_in">sync_with_stdio</span>(<span class="literal">false</span>);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">cin.<span class="built_in">tie</span>(<span class="literal">nullptr</span>);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> t;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">cin &gt;&gt; t;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">while</span> (t--)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">solve</span>();</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
